// ==| USAGE |==
// This module is an index exporter, but it's empty.
// To use library consider importing separated modules.
// Example: `use std.collections.map`
//
// ==| VERSIONING |==
// Standard library versioning is separated from compiler. It's form looks like:
/*
  v1.2.3
      │
      ▼
  ┌─┐┌─┐┌─┐
  │1││2││3│
  └┬┘└┬┘└┬┘
   └──┼──┼► Compiler's major version
      │  │
      └──┼► Compiler's minor version
         │
         └► Library's revision
 */
